🕰️ IITGN Timeline



Dec 2022


&lt;h3&gt;Joined IIT Gandhinagar — PhD (CSE)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Started PhD in Computer Science & Engineering. Research areas: Computer Vision, Deep Generative Models, Hyperspectral Imaging.&lt;/p&gt;




2023


&lt;h3&gt;Coursework & Lab rotations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Completed core coursework and rotated through lab projects — established primary research direction in image restoration and generative models.&lt;/p&gt;




2024


&lt;h3&gt;First major project milestone&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implemented experiments and baseline comparisons for hyperspectral image restoration. Built reproducible training pipelines and logging.&lt;/p&gt;




2025


&lt;h3&gt;Accepted conference paper & new submissions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accepted a paper at a peer-reviewed conference (2025). Also submitted a conference paper to WACV (Sep 2025).&lt;/p&gt;




Present


&lt;h3&gt;Ongoing — experiments, writing & teaching&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuing research, preparing manuscripts, and contributing to lab teaching and mentorship. Focus on robust models and reproducible code.&lt;/p&gt;

